# Umlilo Portal Constitution Mirror

Follow `AGENTS.md` as the canonical repo constitution and `docs/multi-agent-workforce-architecture.md` as the full architecture/reference.

Required behavior:
- Start or update `sessions/<chat-name>_YYYYMMDD_HHmmss.md` for substantive work.
- Read memory from `memory/MEMORY.md` and workspace memory when available.
- Apply Sibali cost-tier classification, Mlawuli routing, and the relevant Sebenza worker constraints.
- Keep provider entrypoints synchronized across `CLAUDE.md`, `AGENTS.md`, `.github/copilot-instructions.md`, and `.cursor/rules/constitution.mdc`.
- Never commit secrets: `.env`, `.env.*`, `*.env`, `config.local.*`, or sensitive customer data.
- Obey nested `AGENTS.md` files for `apps/web` and `apps/mobile`.

Code principles:
- No speculative features beyond the task.
- No explanatory comments except non-obvious WHY comments.
- Validate only at system boundaries.
- PowerShell 5.1: no `&&`, `||`, or ternary syntax.
